Change 1: The draft element 22 spans the full width of the two-line description text (x from about 1160 in crop 1 to 1329+551 → full coordinates ~1160 to ~1880). The change replaces it with a box 615-704 in what appear to be wrong coordinates (those would be in another frame). The proposed green box at crop 1 shows only a fragment on the left side (1160-1329) and in crop 2 ending at x=150, which is a partial piece of the text. This shrinks the box to a fragment of the text, which is worse. So keep.

Change 2: Beta badge exists at crop 1 (310-361, 338-361) in the image, but the proposed box is [164,179,191,191], which doesn't match; yet the green box shown in crop 1 is labeled 2+ at (310-361, 338-361), which does fit the Beta badge. The crop display suggests the box is at the Beta badge. The Beta badge is a real element, so apply.

{"decisions": [{"change": 1, "decision": "keep"}, {"change": 2, "decision": "apply"}]}

The draft box spans x 417–940, but the heading "11 DOLLAR BILL" in the crops: crop 3 shows it starting at x≈443 (crop-local), i.e. full x≈443 (crop 3 starts at x=0 of the full image presumably). In crop 4, "BILL" ends at about x=320 local; crop 4 starts at roughly x=593 (1356−763), so BILL ends at about 913. The red box ends at ~322 local → ~915 full, which fits the text. The proposed green box ends at 87 local → 680 full, which cuts off the heading ("LAR" ends near 87, but "BILL" continues to 320). So the replacement truncates the heading and is wrong.

The draft box (417–940) is slightly wider than the text, but still much better than the truncated one.

{"decisions": [{"change": 1, "decision": "keep"}]}

The heading "Natural Ingredients" spans both crops: it starts around x=631 in crop 1 (full x≈631) and ends around x=1018+384 in crop 2 (full x≈1100 or so). The draft box [470,275,958,343] seems to cover the whole heading, while the proposed replacement [469,276,757,343] is narrower and would cut off the heading before "Ingredients" ends. In crop 2, the red box ends at 385 (full ≈ 1018+385 = 1403 in crop-2 coordinates offset). Crop 2's offset is likely about 411, so the red box spans to about 796... Either way, the green box ends at 116 in crop 2 (full ≈ 527+... ) while the heading text continues to 383 in crop 2. The green box is therefore too narrow, covering only part of the heading, and the red box covers the whole heading.

So the replacement worsens the box.

{"decisions": [{"change": 1, "decision": "keep"}]}
